type: software
title: "PEA-PGNN: Prior-anchored structure-preserving neural prediction"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for prior-anchored, structure-preserving prediction of
  time-dependent engineering responses, with concrete drying shrinkage as the
  first bundled application.
